ey on upper head margin from snout to vertical passing through the pre-opercular margin. Small light brown spots in infraorbital region to operculum, larger (nearly ¼ pupil diameter) on the flanks over the rear border of the scales, forming faint oblique lines. Faint brown horizontal line from the rear eye border to the posterior margin of operculum, width slightly smaller than pupil length. Humeral spot and vertical bars absent. Dorsal fins hyaline with orange hue, anal fin and caudal fin dusky (Fig. 3).","","text","",""]]},"KTV35":{"d":[["Egypt","3868","mrgid","",""]]},"KZKV7":{"d":[["England","16","mrgid","",""]]},"L26V3":{"d":[["MX","MX","iso","",""]]},"L55NY":{"d":[["Italian Exclusive Economic Zone","5682","mrgid","native",""]]},"LJGJV":{"d":[["Distribution. Kenya (Koch 1953); Ethiopia, Tanzania (new records).","","text","",""]]},"LK4R":{"d":[["China (Sichuan)","","text","",""]]},"LNZ8Q":{"d":[["PF","PF","iso","",""]]},"LRF9":{"d":[["","CNT-OO","tdwg","native",""],["","SCA-OO","tdwg","native",""],["USA (CT,RI,SC)","","text","native",""]]},"MKQ4":{"d":[["Curaçaoan part of the Caribbean Sea","26569","mrgid","",""],["Eastern Brazil","21990","mrgid","native",""],["Sao Pedro and Sao Paulo Islands","21993","mrgid","",""],["Southern Caribbean","21984","mrgid","",""]]},"MLCHY":{"d":[["Norway","NO","iso","",""]]},"MQGQG":{"d":[["","TW","iso","native",""]]},"NNYR6":{"d":[["","TW","iso","native",""]]},"NX4C":{"d":[["Palearctic","","text","native",""]]},"P3XB":{"d":[["","TAN-OO","tdwg","native",""],["Tanzania","","text","native",""]]},"P47B":{"d":[["Ceará","19063","mrgid","",""]]},"P775J":{"d":[["North America","","text","",""]]},"PBYR":{"d":[["","NZN","tdwg","",""]]},"PC8R":{"d":[["Madagascan part of the Mozambique Channel","25427","mrgid","",""],["Mozambican Exclusive Economic Zone","8347","mrgid","",""],["Réunion Exclusive Economic Zone","8338","mrgid","",""]]},"PK954":{"d":[["Global","","text","native","near threatened"]]},"PSCGP":{"d":[["Oceania","","text","",""]]},"Q